# Teams Interface & System Guardrails

## 1. The 4 Teams Interaction Modes
*   **Comprehensive Q&A:** Synchronous 200 OK ACK ("Looking into that...") + Asynchronous synthesized answer.
*   **Conversational Data Gathering:** Read/Write capability via native mutation tools.
*   **New Item Notifications:** Mentions MUST use Bot Framework `<at>` tags mapped to Entra ID.
*   **Contextual Chasing:** Idempotent chasing with a 24-hour cooldown per item.

## 2. Critical Circuit Breakers
*   **Friction Circuit Breaker:** 2-turn limit on vague/evasive human responses before graceful exit and PM escalation.
*   **Token Loop Limit:** Maximum 3 schema self-correction attempts before hard fail.
*   **PM Veto:** No automated status report pushes without human authorization.
